# =====================================================
# TEACHER DATA VERIFICATION SCRIPT
# =====================================================
# Use this to verify Pascal Bougong has all necessary data
# for timetable generation
# =====================================================

### 1. Check if teacher exists
GET http://localhost:8086/api/enseignants/8924dc7b-8a43-402c-9756-066925fd6746
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN

### 2. Check teacher's availabilities
GET http://localhost:8088/api/disponibilites/enseignant/8924dc7b-8a43-402c-9756-066925fd6746
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN

### 3. Check teacher's assigned courses (THIS IS KEY!)
GET http://localhost:8086/api/courses/enseignant/8924dc7b-8a43-402c-9756-066925fd6746
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN

### 4. Check available UEs
GET http://localhost:8086/api/ues
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN

### 5. Check available Classes
GET http://localhost:8086/api/classes
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN

### 6. Test timetable generation (should work after setup)
POST http://localhost:8086/api/emplois-du-temps/generer-intelligent/8924dc7b-8a43-402c-9756-066925fd6746?nombreSemaines=1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN

### 7. Check generated timetable
GET http://localhost:8086/api/emplois-du-temps/enseignant/8924dc7b-8a43-402c-9756-066925fd6746
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN

### Expected Results:
# 1. Teacher exists: ✅ Pascal Bougong data
# 2. Availabilities: ✅ 3 availability entries
# 3. Assigned courses: ❌ Empty array (BEFORE setup) → ✅ 5 courses (AFTER setup)
# 4. UEs: ✅ 5 UE entries
# 5. Classes: ✅ 5 class entries
# 6. Generation: ✅ Success message with created entries count
# 7. Generated timetable: ✅ Multiple course entries in time slots

### If step 3 returns empty array:
# - Teacher has no assigned courses
# - Run setup-test-data.bat
# - Re-test step 3

### If step 6 fails:
# - Check UserService logs
# - Verify teacher ID is correct
# - Ensure all services are running